### Raw AG-UI protocol test (VS Code "REST Client" extension). Watch the SSE events stream back.
### Event types to look for: RUN_STARTED, TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT, TOOL_CALL_START/ARGS/END/RESULT, RUN_FINISHED.
@host = http://localhost:5300

### 1. Not signed in -> 401
GET {{host}}/api/pos

### 2. Signed-in PO list
GET {{host}}/api/pos
X-Demo-User: baker
X-Demo-Role: buyer

### 3. One AG-UI run (a new thread id per conversation; reuse it to continue the same chat)
POST {{host}}/ag-ui/triage
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream
X-Demo-User: baker
X-Demo-Role: buyer

{
  "threadId": "demo-thread-1",
  "runId": "run-1",
  "state": {},
  "messages": [ { "id": "m1", "role": "user", "content": "Review PO-100001" } ],
  "tools": [], "context": [], "forwardedProps": {}
}

### 4. Same thread as another user: gets a SEPARATE conversation (session isolation)
POST {{host}}/ag-ui/triage
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream
X-Demo-User: sara
X-Demo-Role: buyer

{
  "threadId": "demo-thread-1",
  "runId": "run-2",
  "state": {},
  "messages": [ { "id": "m2", "role": "user", "content": "approve it" } ],
  "tools": [], "context": [], "forwardedProps": {}
}
